      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This appears to be fixed as of build 1237. Thank you.\nEdit: Disregard above comment, this issue still seems to exist on build 1237.\nEdit 2: The mic selection does seem to update, but only when viewed in the new big menu's audio settings and not in the QM audio settings.\nnew big menu selection: https://i.imgur.com/l5l8cXy.png\nvs QM selection: https://i.imgur.com/W0HFYS6.png",
